   "k": "j6k4di",
   "en": "Strategies and guides"
  },
  {
   "k": "1345498",
   "en": "The below is ⟦0⟧ player suggested strategies for ⟦1⟧. Bear in mind, due to the dynamic nature of the game, it may unfold differently for other players.",
   "frags": 2
  },
  {
   "k": "himl6r",
   "en": "As Ireland, start off by pushing out troops, and then hiring a Fascist Demagogue. For focuses, go down Political Effort and follow the Fascist focuses, after that, do any focus, as Ireland has the Generic Focus Tree. It is best to go Fascist and once that is finished, start justifying a war goal and plan a naval invasion. It is best that you attack the United Kingdom, France, or Spain. Once you have a base ground in Europe, you can go on to attack the rest of the continent. Another strategy would be to join the Axis once you turn Fascist, and fight in a war with Germany in order to get something at a Peace conference."
  },
  {
   "k": "xm5ayc",
   "en": "An alternative good strategy is to use ⟦0⟧ on the ⟦1⟧ to capitulate them with ease around 1939, this will require an early prioritisation of political focuses > industry focuses > rest of focus tree, as well as a small/moderate puppet for manpower. Around late 1937 mid 1938 you should aim to secure said puppet. Ideal conditions require at least 24 divisions and a paratrooper force for when you invade the UK.",
   "frags": 2
  },
  {
   "k": "8jfdwe",
   "en": "collaboration governments"
  },
  {
   "k": "1fhmovo",
   "en": "Utilising ⟦0⟧ and joining the Axis to use ⟦1⟧ ⟦2⟧ can provide multiple fronts to secure a manpower puppet to use against UK. The Benelux nations such as the ⟦3⟧ with its ⟦4⟧ puppet, or ⟦5⟧ are good contenders for early invasion. In addition, ⟦6⟧ can be a good choice. Once paradropping has commenced, move in your ground troops to perform encirclements and capture ⟦7⟧. At a level 2 or 3 collaboration government, invade Britain with paratroopers before they intervene in the German invasion of ⟦8⟧. The UK should capitulate without much difficulty, providing you micromanage troops. Remember to drop the paratroopers on ports so that you can bring your main armies in.",
   "frags": 9
  },
  {
   "k": "aummzv",
   "en": "paratroopers"
  },
  {
   "k": "4qfm7n",
   "en": "German"
  },
  {
   "k": "1ki9gvf",
   "en": "airbases"
